=== (1) folding identity: N-site NN cell spectrum vs fine NN chain at K = k + 2 pi n ===
N=  2: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 4.4e-16
N=  3: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 4.9e-16
N=  4: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 5.6e-16
N=  8: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 4.4e-16
N= 16: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 7.8e-16
N= 32: max |eig W(k) - w^2_fine(k+2pi n)| / bandwidth = 6.7e-16
-> the N-site cell is the fine chain (spacing a/N) folded; bands touch exactly at the coarse faces/centre.

